  "amendment_reasons": {
    "a": "Control for CCS polygon size and compare against area alone before attributing improvement to accessible production.",
    "b": "Interpret this proxy-specific test descriptively, with limited and potentially unstable CAR-block bootstrap power.",
    "c": "A registry close to a census cannot establish robustness to documentation bias; the crop raster belongs to a possible future v2 only.",
    "d": "Describe coverage and spatial performance without production-dependent features without overriding the primary rule.",
    "e": "Publicly pin the committed method and tag on the remote before accepting registration."
